'''Shen's Auction''' is a [[Location]] under the [[Auction House]], where certain items are auctioned.

== Mechanics ==
Every SkyBlock Year<!-- (SkyBlock Day on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]])-->, a new auction will start. Players can bid on items that are being auctioned on '''Shen's Auction''' and '''Shen's Special'''. The top bidders on items can claim the items after the auction has ended. Not all items will always appear.

* {{NPCSprite|Mayor Diaz|Mayor Diaz}} elected with the {{gold|Volume Trading}} perk doubles the quantity of all items available to buy on both '''Shen's Auction''' and '''Shen's Special'''.
* {{Gamemode|Ironman}} players have {{Green|50%}} of the normal stock available. Additionally, {{Gamemode|Ironman}} players bid separately from {{Gamemode|Classic}} profiles. All items claimed from Ironman Shen's Auction are automatically {{Soulbound|Co-op}}.
* {{Gamemode|Bingo}} players are blocked from this feature.
* {{Gamemode|Stranded}} players do not have access to this feature.

